      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it's not really like that. i'm not like... in a crisis or anything. it's just this feeling of being totally invisible. like i'm just some part of the landscape that's eventually gonna wash away. does that even make sense? just feeling like there's no impact either way.",
