    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it's just hard to find a reason to bother with \"small actions\" when it feels like nothing i do actually matters. if i'm just passing through anyway, what's the point of even trying to change anything? it feels more peaceful to just accept that i'm not really here. like, wouldn't it be easier if i just let go of everything and stopped fighting it?",
